{
  "_README": [
    "Google Places API (New) Text Search responses, written to the documented",
    "`places:searchText` schema. **Not recorded from a live call** \u2014 session P2",
    "was forbidden from making one, and saying 'recorded' about a file that was",
    "typed would be the kind of claim this project keeps finding underneath a",
    "green check. Every field name, nesting and spelling here is the published",
    "shape; what is invented is the data.",
    "",
    "Every number is in the 555 reserved range (+1 555-555-12xx / 13xx, a block",
    "no other test module uses) and every business is fictional, so nothing here",
    "identifies a person or a company.",
    "",
    "`nationalPhoneNumber` and `internationalPhoneNumber` are Enterprise-SKU",
    "fields. `enterprise_tier_missing` is what the same query returns on a key",
    "without that tier: it parses cleanly and carries no way to contact anybody.",
    "",
    "No test in this repo calls the real API."
  ],
